WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.096
Which offer is really better?

00:00:05.096 --> 00:00:06.975
And who do you know there?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.775
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.703
The Comps tab puts the jobs you're still in the running for side by side,

00:00:17.703 --> 00:00:19.800
with a suggestion and the reasons.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.916
Pay, fit, stage and the people you know.

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:28.050
In each column, the best value gets a star.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.251
Your LinkedIn connections export, which you download from LinkedIn,

00:00:33.251 --> 00:00:36.275
shows who you know at each company, closest first.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.767
Set your pay target and floor in Settings.

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:41.675
They stay on this computer.
